00:02:41.161 --> 00:02:42.328
Mm, maybe.


00:02:43.163 --> 00:02:45.373
But she is going to college.


00:02:45.457 --> 00:02:48.501
You think she wants to smell like horses
all the time like you?


00:02:48.836 --> 00:02:51.128
