00:02:51.588 --> 00:02:54.507
No, para Nada, if you like horses.


00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.672
Take 'em down!


00:03:43.015 --> 00:03:44.655
Make no mistake about it.


00:03:46.351 --> 00:03:48.144
