00:04:32.314 --> 00:04:33.314
Letter opener?


00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.274
It'd be beautiful on your desk.


00:04:36.026 --> 00:04:37.068
Oh.


00:04:37.653 --> 00:04:41.989
