00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:08.057
Even before your age.


00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:10.518
Did you like it?


00:05:10.936 --> 00:05:14.814
Well, I had some of the best friends
I ever had for a while.


00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:21.487
